{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_94fb5d84", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T09:28:00", "text": "Hi team, I've shared the <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/abaix_market_research_report|Market Research Report> for abAIX. Let's discuss and refine it together. Looking forward to your feedback! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260525-0-a6728"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260525-0-a6728"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_782010a4", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T09:33:00", "text": "Thanks for sharing, Charlie! Overall, the report looks comprehensive. One suggestion for the Executive Summary: could we add a brief mention of the specific industries where abAIX has already seen success? This might help in showcasing our credibility. @eid_94fb5d84", "utterranceID": "20260525-1-b3c50"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260525-1-b3c50"}
