{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0c373165", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T09:38:00", "text": "I agree with Bob. Adding data can make our case more compelling. Additionally, in the Product Features section, could we elaborate on the 'real-time collaboration capabilities'? Maybe provide a specific example of how it enhances productivity. @eid_94fb5d84", "utterranceID": "20260525-3-bae39"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260525-3-bae39"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-abaix-c92927"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_53a6add1", "timestamp": "2026-05-25T09:43:00", "text": "From a UX perspective, it might be beneficial to include some user feedback or case studies in the Target Audience section. This could provide a more human element to the report. What do you think, Charlie?", "utterranceID": "20260525-4-70435"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260525-4-70435"}
