{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:43:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with LeadForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260902-0-6da62"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-0-6da62"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:44:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue titled 'API Rate Limiting Causes Delayed Lead Updates'. The API Gateway is throttling requests during high traffic, causing delays in lead updates. This is impacting Customer CUST-0003. @eid_a43a4389, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260902-1-9ac99"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-1-9ac99"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:47:00", "text": "Got it! I'll look into the API rate limiting issue and see how we can optimize it to prevent delays. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260902-2-c14a8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-2-c14a8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:50:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Load Balancer Misconfiguration' issue. The load balancer is unevenly distributing requests, causing some servers to overload. This is affecting Customer CUST-0078. @eid_a23a73c4, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260902-3-eefb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-3-eefb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:52:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll dive into the load balancer settings and ensure even distribution across servers. Let's get this sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20260902-4-d3d2d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-4-d3d2d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:56:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Faulty Data Aggregation Logic' issue. The system is aggregating lead engagement metrics incorrectly, leading to skewed scores. This is impacting Customer CUST-0109. @eid_207da0e7, can you take a look?", "utterranceID": "20260902-5-973a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-5-973a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-03T01:57:00", "text": "On it! I'll review the data aggregation logic and make sure the lead scores are accurate. Thanks for flagging this! 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260902-6-ef1f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260902-6-ef1f8"}
