{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2026-04-22T23:09:00", "text": "Thanks so much, everyone! Really appreciate the feedback and approvals. Glad you all liked the design! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260422-7-ce186"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260422-7-ce186"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T09:43:00", "text": "Hi team, I came across some interesting open-source projects that have features similar to our proposed PR on intelligent notification triggers with edge computing. Thought it would be great to discuss them and see what insights we can gather. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260424-0-87e9d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-0-87e9d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T09:44:00", "text": "First up, we have a feature from Kubernetes titled 'Edge Node Event Processing'. It focuses on real-time event processing on edge nodes to improve system responsiveness and reduce latency. Here's the link: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/3547. What do you guys think?", "utterranceID": "20260424-1-8ebe4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-1-8ebe4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e214d622", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T09:49:00", "text": "Hey @eid_136119e9, this sounds quite aligned with what we're aiming for. Real-time processing at the edge is crucial for reducing latency. We should definitely consider how they handle event processing and see if we can adapt some of their strategies. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260424-2-623c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-2-623c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f29a0d", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T09:54:00", "text": "Agreed, Alice. Kubernetes is known for its robust architecture. If they have a solid approach to edge processing, it could be a great reference for us. Maybe we can look into their event handling mechanisms in more detail?", "utterranceID": "20260424-3-2fc2c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-3-2fc2c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T09:55:00", "text": "Great points, both! I'll dive deeper into their implementation and see what we can learn. Next, let's look at Apache Kafka's feature 'Edge Stream Notification Enhancements'. It enhances the notification system to trigger alerts based on edge stream data analysis. Here's the link: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/3548.", "utterranceID": "20260424-4-7248a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-4-7248a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_55f29a0d", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T09:57:00", "text": "Kafka's focus on stream data analysis is interesting. Their approach to handling real-time data could offer us some valuable insights, especially in terms of scalability and efficiency. We should definitely consider their notification triggers.", "utterranceID": "20260424-5-a89c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-5-a89c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e214d622", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T10:01:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie. Kafka's expertise in stream processing is top-notch. If they have a way to efficiently trigger notifications from edge data, it could be a game-changer for us. Let's keep this on our radar.", "utterranceID": "20260424-6-8c3e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-6-8c3e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-georgegarcia-WorkFlowGenie", "channelID": "ch-owaix-db5d92"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_136119e9", "timestamp": "2026-04-24T10:06:00", "text": "Noted! I'll make sure to analyze their notification system further. Lastly, we have TensorFlow's 'Edge Model Deployment Notifications'. This feature introduces a notification system for successful model deployments on edge devices. Check it out here: https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/pull/3549.", "utterranceID": "20260424-7-b9d0a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260424-7-b9d0a"}

