{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2026-11-07T08:26:00", "text": "Can't wait for users to experience this improvement. Nice work, team! 👏", "utterranceID": "20261110-10-91f8d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261110-10-91f8d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_88c661bc", "timestamp": "2026-11-08T12:28:00", "text": "@here check some functionalities of our product here https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/ContextForce/demo_2", "utterranceID": "20261108-0-508b0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261108-0-508b0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:14:00", "text": "Hi team, I wanted to kick off a discussion about our proposed feature to enhance data visualization options. I've found some similar features in open-source projects that might give us some inspiration. Let's dive in! 😊", "utterranceID": "20261112-0-79524"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-0-79524"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:18:00", "text": "First up, we have Apache Superset's [Advanced Chart Customization](https://github.com/apache/superset/pull/2719). This PR introduces new chart types and enhanced customization options for better data visualization. What do you think, @eid_ecaa9084?", "utterranceID": "20261112-1-38667"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-1-38667"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:22:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie! This sounds quite similar to what we're aiming for. Superset's approach to customization could really help us understand how to offer more flexibility to our users. I think it's definitely worth considering their implementation details. 👍", "utterranceID": "20261112-2-50b91"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-2-50b91"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:27:00", "text": "Agreed, Julia. Superset's focus on customization aligns well with our goals. It might be useful to see how they handle user interactions with these new chart types. Could be a good reference for us. 📊", "utterranceID": "20261112-3-a7c53"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-3-a7c53"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-xtaix-a13f5d"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2026-11-13T05:32:00", "text": "Great points! Next, let's look at Grafana's [Dynamic Dashboard Widgets](https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/2720). This PR adds new widget types and customization settings to enhance dashboard interactivity and data representation. Thoughts, George?", "utterranceID": "20261112-4-b7dfe"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261112-4-b7dfe"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:16:00", "text": "First up, there's a 'Rate Limiting Misconfiguration' issue in the Django REST Framework. Third-party apps are facing unexpected rate limiting, similar to what we're seeing with ContextForce. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/django/django/pull/1980. @eid_ecaa9084, this might be useful for your work on the API Authentication Module. Thoughts? 🤔", "utterranceID": "20270228-1-3c65f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-1-3c65f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:17:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! This looks quite similar to our issue. I'll review the PR to see how they addressed the rate limiting and see if we can apply any of their solutions. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270228-2-02cc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-2-02cc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:22:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have a 'Weak Encryption Algorithm Usage' issue in OpenSSL. They're dealing with outdated encryption algorithms, which is exactly what we're facing in our Data Transmission & Security Layer. Here's the PR: https://github.com/openssl/openssl/pull/1981. Charlie, this might give you some insights for updating our encryption. 🔐", "utterranceID": "20270228-3-860ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-3-860ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:24:00", "text": "Perfect timing, Julia! I'll dive into their approach and see how they upgraded their encryption algorithms. This could definitely help us ensure our data security. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270228-4-7ca86"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-4-7ca86"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:27:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Charlie! Lastly, there's a 'Man-in-the-Middle Attack Susceptibility' issue in Nginx. They're working on establishing a secure channel to prevent data interception, which is similar to what we're addressing. Here's the PR: https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/1982. David, this might be relevant for your work. 🔒", "utterranceID": "20270228-5-c3509"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-5-c3509"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Julia! I'll check out how Nginx is handling the secure channel establishment. It might give us some good ideas for our implementation. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270228-6-6f5d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-6-6f5d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa16fefb", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:31:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these references in mind as we work on our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. Let's get these bugs squashed! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270228-7-faae6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-7-faae6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_14a5889d", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:36:00", "text": "Will do, Julia! Let's make sure our solutions are top-notch. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270228-8-40150"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-8-40150"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ecaa9084", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:38:00", "text": "Agreed, let's keep the momentum going! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270228-9-b370f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-9-b370f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2542cff3", "timestamp": "2027-03-01T07:39:00", "text": "Absolutely, team effort! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270228-10-0170b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270228-10-0170b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:17:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about 'Temporal Data Misinterpretation' where reports were showing misleading trends due to incorrect time-series data analysis.", "utterranceID": "20270308-0-790f8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-0-790f8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-juliataylor-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-3aa08e"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8d6fe78d", "timestamp": "2027-03-09T02:19:00", "text": "After a thorough review, I've determined that this does not require a fix. The behavior is actually expected due to a misconfiguration in the user settings.", "utterranceID": "20270308-1-cc048"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270308-1-cc048"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T16:17:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, George Brown. So, it's more of a configuration issue rather than a malfunction?", "utterranceID": "20270123-4-ba3dd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-4-ba3dd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T16:19:00", "text": "Exactly, George Jones. I reviewed the configuration logs and confirmed that the threshold values were not aligned with the expected parameters for detecting smaller anomalies.", "utterranceID": "20270123-5-46678"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-5-46678"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T16:24:00", "text": "Got it. So, should we adjust the configuration settings to prevent this from happening again?", "utterranceID": "20270123-6-6a656"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-6-6a656"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T16:28:00", "text": "Yes, Ian. I've already updated the documentation to include recommended threshold settings. I'll also coordinate with the team responsible for monitoring to ensure they adjust their configurations accordingly.", "utterranceID": "20270123-7-6ae38"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-7-6ae38"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5782059f", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T16:31:00", "text": "Great work, George Brown. Thanks for the update and for clarifying the situation.", "utterranceID": "20270123-8-8be82"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-8-8be82"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b4d260c1", "timestamp": "2027-01-23T16:32:00", "text": "No problem, happy to help. Let me know if there's anything else you need.", "utterranceID": "20270123-9-77687"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270123-9-77687"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iansmith-ContextForce", "channelID": "ch-force-5ff1be"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_82e9fcef", "timestamp": "2027-01-25T05:57:00", "text": "Hi team, the 'Anomaly Detection Failure' bug has been reopened by CUST-0031. They reported that the reports are still missing some critical anomalies. 😕", "utterranceID": "20270124-0-0abec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270124-0-0abec"}
