{"Channel": {"name": "develop-iantaylor-AutoTuneForce", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-66a156"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_5780b68c", "timestamp": "2026-07-25T21:00:00", "text": "First up, we have a feature from Hyperledger Fabric: the Smart Contract Security Layer. It introduces a security layer for smart contracts to prevent unauthorized access and ensure data integrity. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/hyperledger/fabric/pull/3004. What do you think, @eid_65324b8a?", "utterranceID": "20260725-1-4ede4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260725-1-4ede4"}
