{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:01:00", "text": "Agreed. We should look into all these aspects and see where improvements can be made.", "utterranceID": "20260705-9-0a24a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-9-0a24a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:02:00", "text": "Let's make sure these issues are documented in the planning documents for the next release of ATF_AIX.", "utterranceID": "20260705-10-9ff94"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-10-9ff94"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:06:00", "text": "Absolutely. I'll start drafting some notes on this.", "utterranceID": "20260705-11-99d08"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-11-99d08"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-17T09:07:00", "text": "Great. Thanks, everyone, for the input. Let's keep this momentum going.", "utterranceID": "20260705-12-1d006"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260705-12-1d006"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:06:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers have reported positive things about ATF_AIX. It's great to see such feedback!", "utterranceID": "20260903-0-60416"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-0-60416"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:09:00", "text": "That's awesome! What did they say, Bob?", "utterranceID": "20260903-1-148ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-1-148ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:14:00", "text": "Customer CUST-0093 praised the platform for its robust performance on high-end systems, especially with large datasets. No significant lag reported!", "utterranceID": "20260903-2-17541"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-2-17541"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:17:00", "text": "Impressive! Handling large datasets efficiently is a big win. Kudos to the previous team!", "utterranceID": "20260903-3-f4299"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-3-f4299"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_35e32fec", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:18:00", "text": "@eid_2490c02c Any other feedback?", "utterranceID": "20260903-4-ec1eb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-4-ec1eb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_2490c02c", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:19:00", "text": "Yes, Ian. Customer CUST-0029 mentioned that the Einstein Auto-Tuning feature offers comprehensive analytics and insights. It helps users understand the impact of parameter changes on model performance.", "utterranceID": "20260903-5-85799"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-5-85799"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_ad0725a2", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:21:00", "text": "That's a great feature to highlight. Understanding parameter impacts is crucial for our users.", "utterranceID": "20260903-6-9ac85"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-6-9ac85"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8c71a7a9", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:23:00", "text": "Agreed, David. It's nice to see the product being appreciated. We should keep these strengths in mind for future updates.", "utterranceID": "20260903-7-74bcb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-7-74bcb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:25:00", "text": "Definitely. Let's make sure we maintain these strengths while adding our own improvements.", "utterranceID": "20260903-8-dee1f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-8-dee1f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6f719d21", "timestamp": "2026-06-18T17:28:00", "text": "Sounds like a plan. Let's keep the momentum going!", "utterranceID": "20260903-9-282bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260903-9-282bc"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_7f22371d", "timestamp": "2026-07-03T05:52:00", "text": "Regarding third-party integrations, the document should specify supported data formats and protocols. This could help users understand the system's capabilities and limitations better. We might need to expand our API support to include more data sources.", "utterranceID": "20260701-5-758b4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260701-5-758b4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0719bc3e", "timestamp": "2026-07-03T05:53:00", "text": "Fiona, that's a good point. We should also consider partnerships with more data providers to enhance our integration capabilities. This could be mentioned in the future plans section.", "utterranceID": "20260701-6-d0b6b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260701-6-d0b6b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-07-03T05:56:00", "text": "For the reliability issues, we need to enhance our error handling and failover mechanisms. The document should include a section on how we plan to test and improve system reliability under high data loads. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20260701-7-31dec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260701-7-31dec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6bd20afa", "timestamp": "2026-07-03T05:58:00", "text": "@Hannah Johnson, I think we should also add a section on user interface improvements. Simplifying the design and adding user-friendly navigation features could reduce the learning curve for new users.", "utterranceID": "20260701-8-96d0b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260701-8-96d0b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-07-03T06:03:00", "text": "Great suggestions, everyone! Here's a summary of the key changes: 1) Add optimization strategies for low-power systems, 2) Enhance user documentation with guides and visuals, 3) Expand third-party integration details, 4) Improve error handling and reliability testing, 5) Simplify the user interface. Let's assign tasks to update these sections and aim to have a draft ready by next week. Thanks for the input! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260701-9-1ca71"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260701-9-1ca71"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b67edbb4", "timestamp": "2026-07-03T20:08:00", "text": "Here is the updated <https://sf-internal.slack.com/archives/docs/new_atf_aix_system_design_document|System Design Document>, thank you everyone!", "utterranceID": "20260703-0-dffd0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260703-0-dffd0"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0719bc3e", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T07:54:00", "text": "For reliability, let's include more robust error handling and failover mechanisms in the specs. We should also document testing procedures for high-load scenarios.", "utterranceID": "20260629-7-53282"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-7-53282"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_061285c7", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T07:57:00", "text": "I agree, David. Adding a section on system bottlenecks and how to mitigate them could be useful too.", "utterranceID": "20260629-8-44df8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260629-8-44df8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-ATF_AIX", "channelID": "ch-f_aix-3a5e7c"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e42b000f", "timestamp": "2026-06-29T07:58:00", "text": "On the UI front, we should simplify the interface and improve navigation

{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_724e1180", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:18:00", "text": "Sure, the integration was designed to allow seamless data flow between our systems using GraphQL, which would have improved data fetching efficiency. But if we're not moving forward with GraphQL, I understand the need to reconsider.", "utterranceID": "20261102-4-4d9f0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-4-4d9f0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f3ea10f", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:23:00", "text": "Given the shift in focus, does anyone see any immediate issues if we revert the PR? Any dependencies that might break?", "utterranceID": "20261102-5-9bf68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-5-9bf68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_446bc3ee", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:28:00", "text": "I don't think there are any dependencies that would be affected. The integration was quite isolated, so reverting should be straightforward.", "utterranceID": "20261102-6-7fcc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-6-7fcc6"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_9c876927", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:33:00", "text": "Agreed. I haven't seen any issues that would arise from reverting. It seems like the best course of action given the circumstances.", "utterranceID": "20261102-7-6d2c9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-7-6d2c9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "develop-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-de9cfb"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_b7a6e7f9", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T05:36:00", "text": "Alright, it sounds like reverting is the consensus. @eid_724e1180, could you handle the revert for PR# 36?", "utterranceID": "20261102-8-ff721"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261102-8-ff721"}
