{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2026-08-19T18:14:00", "text": "@eid_802e8eff joined bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce. Also, @eid_31cb6db5, @eid_fc4619fa, @eid_6cc1a0f6, @eid_443fee06, @eid_4cede092 joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20260819-1-51490"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-1-51490"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T03:57:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SentimentForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-0-c3acd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-0-c3acd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T03:58:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Connection Pool Exhaustion' issue. The database connection pool is frequently exhausted, causing delays in establishing new connections for sentiment data retrieval. This affects the Database Management System and is impacting Customer CUST-0034. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20260819-1-367b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-1-367b5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:03:00", "text": "Sure thing! I'll look into the connection pool configuration and see what's causing the exhaustion. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20260819-2-de8ee"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-2-de8ee"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:08:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Stale Sentiment Cache Issue'. The sentiment analysis results are being served from an outdated cache, which affects the Real-Time Dashboard & Backend Server. This is impacting Customer CUST-0006. @eid_4cede092, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20260819-3-b86ca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-3-b86ca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:12:00", "text": "Got it! I'll investigate the caching mechanism and ensure the dashboard reflects real-time data. Thanks for assigning this to me! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20260819-4-25da5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-4-25da5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:15:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks! Lastly, there's a 'Negation Handling Error in Sentiment Parsing'. The sentiment analysis engine isn't correctly interpreting negations, leading to incorrect sentiment scores. This affects the Sentiment Analysis Engine and is also impacting Customer CUST-0034. @eid_6cc1a0f6, can you take this one as well?", "utterranceID": "20260819-5-2ec27"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-5-2ec27"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, I'll dive into the sentiment parsing logic and fix the negation handling. Thanks for letting me know! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-6-c03f3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-6-c03f3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:22:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep our customers happy and resolve these issues ASAP. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or additional info. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260819-7-ef4ed"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-7-ef4ed"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:23:00", "text": "Will do! Let's get these sorted out. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260819-8-5c198"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-8-5c198"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-20T04:24:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for coordinating, @eid_802e8eff! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260819-9-7e3a0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260819-9-7e3a0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-22T14:53:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that might help us with our current issues. Let's take a look at them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20260822-0-91ccc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260822-0-91ccc"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T14:55:00", "text": "Since this is an external API issue and not something within our control, a fix on our end isn't necessary. It's not a bug in our system.", "utterranceID": "20261207-3-e2a89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-3-e2a89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:00:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. So, it's more about handling the API's limitations rather than a bug in our code?", "utterranceID": "20261207-4-04277"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-4-04277"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:02:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_8658e19c. We could consider implementing retries or caching to mitigate the impact, but the core issue lies with the API's availability.", "utterranceID": "20261207-5-ad120"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-5-ad120"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:05:00", "text": "Makes sense, Fiona. Thanks for clarifying. Do we need to inform the users about this behavior?", "utterranceID": "20261207-6-3cb92"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-6-3cb92"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:06:00", "text": "Good point, Emma. I suggest we add a note in the user documentation about potential data gaps due to Slack API connectivity issues.", "utterranceID": "20261207-7-ce066"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-7-ce066"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:11:00", "text": "Agreed. Let's make sure users are aware. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Fiona!", "utterranceID": "20261207-8-289bc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-8-289bc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-07T15:14:00", "text": "No problem, Bob. I'll draft a note for the documentation and share it with you all for review.", "utterranceID": "20261207-9-3b9de"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261207-9-3b9de"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:08:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the delayed sentiment updates in the real-time dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20261211-0-f29f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-0-f29f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:13:00", "text": "After reviewing the system logs and running some tests, I've determined that this is not a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20261211-1-ecdde"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-1-ecdde"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:16:00", "text": "The delays are due to expected network latency and the current data processing setup on the backend server.", "utterranceID": "20261211-2-2a44a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-2-2a44a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:20:00", "text": "Our system is designed to prioritize data accuracy over speed, which can result in slight delays in sentiment updates.", "utterranceID": "20261211-3-0032a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-3-0032a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:21:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, it's more about how the system is configured rather than an actual issue?", "utterranceID": "20261211-4-5d838"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-4-5d838"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:22:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_d96fb219. The system is functioning as intended, ensuring that the sentiment scores are accurate even if there's a small delay.", "utterranceID": "20261211-5-3f0e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-5-3f0e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:23:00", "text": "Did you find any way to improve the processing speed, or is it best to leave it as is?", "utterranceID": "20261211-6-af98e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-6-af98e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:26:00", "text": "I did explore some optimization options, Bob, but any changes would compromise data accuracy, which is not ideal for our use case.", "utterranceID": "20261211-7-cd013"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-7-cd013"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:28:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Ian. It's good to know that the system is working as expected. Maybe we should update the documentation to reflect this behavior?", "utterranceID": "20261211-8-c37e0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-8-c37e0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-12-11T20:29:00", "text": "Great idea, Fiona. I'll coordinate with the documentation team to ensure this is clearly communicated to users.", "utterranceID": "20261211-9-82fc6"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261211-9-82fc6"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:14:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's leverage these insights to improve our solutions. If you need any more info or run into issues, just ping me. Let's keep up the great work, team! 💪", "utterranceID": "20261002-7-66b65"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-7-66b65"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:15:00", "text": "Will do, thanks for the resources, Emma! It's always helpful to learn from the open-source community. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261002-8-17fca"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-8-17fca"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-03T00:16:00", "text": "Absolutely, thanks for coordinating, Emma! Let's get these issues sorted out. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20261002-9-b432b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261002-9-b432b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:40:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Query Execution Plan' has been resolved. You can check out the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/39.", "utterranceID": "20261006-0-953d7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-0-953d7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:42:00", "text": "The root cause was due to a lack of updated statistics and missing query optimization hints, which led to the database generating suboptimal execution plans for retrieving sentiment data.", "utterranceID": "20261006-1-6de80"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-1-6de80"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:47:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the statistics on the relevant tables and added specific query optimization hints to guide the database management system towards more efficient execution paths.", "utterranceID": "20261006-2-455fb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-2-455fb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:51:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_fa6ec727! This should help improve the query processing times significantly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-3-f16c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-3-f16c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:53:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-4-ebb1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:55:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob and Emma! Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20261006-5-f96d0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-5-f96d0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-06T13:56:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Thanks again for the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20261006-6-c5cec"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261006-6-c5cec"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:44:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the security vulnerability in the user authentication module.", "utterranceID": "20261008-0-ffc40"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-0-ffc40"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:48:00", "text": "The concern was that a flaw allows unauthorized access to sentiment analysis reports, which could risk data privacy.", "utterranceID": "20261008-1-05881"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-1-05881"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:51:00", "text": "After reviewing the details, I found that this is not actually a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20261008-2-37440"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-2-37440"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:52:00", "text": "Hey Fiona, could you explain why it's not a bug? It sounded serious.", "utterranceID": "20261008-3-e05e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-3-e05e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:56:00", "text": "Sure, Bob. The issue stems from a misunderstanding of how our authentication tokens are supposed to work.", "utterranceID": "20261008-4-f8949"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-4-f8949"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T01:57:00", "text": "The tokens are indeed validated and encrypted correctly. The unauthorized access was due to a misconfiguration in the user roles on the client side.", "utterranceID": "20261008-5-d5995"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-5-d5995"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-10-09T02:02:00", "text": "@eid_fa6ec727 So, it was a configuration issue rather than a code problem?", "utterranceID": "20261008-6-936bf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261008-6-936bf"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:19:00", "text": "Absolutely, Charlie! This is quite similar to what we're seeing with SentimentForce. I'll review their approach and see if we can apply any of their solutions to our Real-Time Dashboard. Thanks for sharing! 👍", "utterranceID": "20261019-2-e3d26"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-2-e3d26"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:24:00", "text": "Great! Next up, we have a 'Token Expiry Misconfiguration' in OAuth2 Proxy. Their access tokens aren't expiring as expected, which is a security risk. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/oauth2-proxy/oauth2-proxy/pull/172. David, this seems to align with our token expiry issue. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20261019-3-a4a66"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-3-a4a66"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:29:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie, this is very relevant! I'll dive into their PR to see how they tackled the token expiry problem. It might give us some insights for our User Authentication Module. Security first! 🔒", "utterranceID": "20261019-4-d805d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-4-d805d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:30:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks David! Lastly, there's a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) in Comment Section' vulnerability in WordPress. Attackers can inject scripts in the comment section, which is similar to our login page issue. Here's the PR: https://github.com/WordPress/WordPress/pull/173. Can you also take a look at this one?", "utterranceID": "20261019-5-992e5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-5-992e5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:31:00", "text": "Sure thing, Charlie! I'll review their fix for the XSS vulnerability and see if we can apply similar measures to secure our login page. 🛡️", "utterranceID": "20261019-6-13d2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-6-13d2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:33:00", "text": "Thanks, David! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our bugs. If you need any help or want to discuss further, just ping me. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20261019-7-3439e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-7-3439e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fc4619fa", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:37:00", "text": "Will do, Charlie! I'll update you once I have more insights from the Django PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20261019-8-02a6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-8-02a6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T05:39:00", "text": "Same here, I'll keep you posted on both the OAuth2 Proxy and WordPress issues. Thanks for coordinating, Charlie!", "utterranceID": "20261019-9-9c9c0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261019-9-9c9c0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:29:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect sarcasm detection in our sentiment analysis engine has been resolved. You can check the details here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/40", "utterranceID": "20261021-0-bc593"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-0-bc593"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:32:00", "text": "That's great news, Ian! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261021-1-2822d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-1-2822d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:37:00", "text": "Sure, David. The root cause was that our sentiment model lacked advanced contextual understanding and tone detection, which are crucial for identifying sarcasm.", "utterranceID": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-2-e7e4c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:42:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, @eid_31cb6db5?", "utterranceID": "20261021-3-dee68"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-3-dee68"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_31cb6db5", "timestamp": "2026-10-21T23:44:00", "text": "Good question, Charlie. We enhanced the model by integrating a new layer that uses transformer-based architecture to better understand context and tone. This allows it to differentiate between literal and sarcastic remarks more effectively.", "utterranceID": "20261021-4-70cf9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261021-4-70cf9"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-25T08:42:00", "text": "Will do. Thanks again, Fiona!", "utterranceID": "20261124-6-7b017"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261124-6-7b017"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T22:28:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'API Rate Limiting Causes Data Fetch Failures' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/46.", "utterranceID": "20261127-0-0e690"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-0-0e690"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T22:33:00", "text": "The root cause was that our system didn't implement proper rate limiting and retry mechanisms when interacting with the Slack API. This led to exceeding the API rate limits and resulted in failed data fetch attempts.", "utterranceID": "20261127-1-81946"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-1-81946"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T22:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I added a rate limiting middleware that queues requests and retries them with exponential backoff if they fail due to rate limits. This ensures we stay within the API limits and complete all data fetches successfully.", "utterranceID": "20261127-2-a1c6e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-2-a1c6e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T22:41:00", "text": "Great work, Ian! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. This should really improve the reliability of our sentiment analysis.", "utterranceID": "20261127-3-52b2b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-3-52b2b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T22:45:00", "text": "@eid_8658e19c Thanks, Ian! I'll test this with some of our larger datasets to ensure everything is working smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261127-4-9643d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-4-9643d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-27T22:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and Emma. Let me know if you encounter any issues during testing. I'm here to help!", "utterranceID": "20261127-5-57d01"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261127-5-57d01"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:11:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect OAuth token handling has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SentimentForce/pull/47.", "utterranceID": "20261129-0-8ac30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-0-8ac30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:12:00", "text": "To recap, the issue was that our API Integration Module wasn't refreshing expired OAuth tokens automatically. This led to unauthorized API requests and interruptions in data retrieval from Slack channels.", "utterranceID": "20261129-1-40bc9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-1-40bc9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:14:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian! What was causing the token refresh mechanism to fail?", "utterranceID": "20261129-2-121e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-2-121e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:18:00", "text": "Good question, @eid_fa6ec727. The root cause was a missing trigger in our token management logic. The system wasn't set up to initiate a refresh when a token expired.", "utterranceID": "20261129-3-561d3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-3-561d3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:19:00", "text": "How did you manage to fix it, Ian?", "utterranceID": "20261129-4-07641"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-4-07641"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_8658e19c", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:23:00", "text": "I added a check for token expiration before each API request. If a token is expired, the system now automatically triggers a refresh and retries the request with the new token. This ensures uninterrupted data retrieval.", "utterranceID": "20261129-5-f54dc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-5-f54dc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_fa6ec727", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:28:00", "text": "That sounds like a solid fix. Thanks for handling this so quickly, Ian!", "utterranceID": "20261129-6-8fc36"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-6-8fc36"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-664c13"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2026-11-29T12:30:00", "text": "Agreed, great work! I'll keep an eye on the logs to ensure everything runs smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20261129-7-fc6d8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261129-7-fc6d8"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:37:00", "text": "To fix this, I increased the connection pool size and implemented a connection reuse strategy that efficiently manages idle connections. This should prevent the pool from being exhausted during peak loads.", "utterranceID": "20260825-2-19303"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-2-19303"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:42:00", "text": "Great work, David! Thanks for addressing this so quickly. I'll keep an eye on the performance metrics to ensure everything is stable.", "utterranceID": "20260825-3-232a3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-3-232a3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:45:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_6cc1a0f6! This should really help with the delays we've been experiencing. Let me know if there's anything else you need from my side.", "utterranceID": "20260825-4-d260b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-4-d260b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-26T00:49:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian and Charlie. Please let me know if you notice any further issues. I'll be monitoring the system closely for the next few days.", "utterranceID": "20260825-5-ef489"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260825-5-ef489"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T07:58:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the 'Stale Sentiment Cache'. The concern was that outdated sentiment data was being displayed on the dashboard.", "utterranceID": "20260828-0-c903a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-0-c903a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:01:00", "text": "After reviewing the cache invalidation policy, I found that the current behavior is actually expected. The cache is designed to refresh every 24 hours to balance performance and data freshness.", "utterranceID": "20260828-1-e3848"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-1-e3848"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:06:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Ian. So, it's not a bug but rather a feature of our caching strategy?", "utterranceID": "20260828-2-0a039"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-2-0a039"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:08:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_6cc1a0f6. The policy is set to ensure that we don't overwhelm the backend with frequent requests, which could degrade performance.", "utterranceID": "20260828-3-1c18b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-3-1c18b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:11:00", "text": "Makes sense. Did you verify that the cache is indeed refreshing as expected every 24 hours?", "utterranceID": "20260828-4-ac355"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-4-ac355"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4cede092", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:16:00", "text": "Yes, Charlie. I checked the logs and confirmed that the cache invalidation is occurring as scheduled. No anomalies were found.", "utterranceID": "20260828-5-0f7e7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-5-0f7e7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_6cc1a0f6", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:17:00", "text": "Good to know. Thanks for clarifying, Ian. I think we can close this as not requiring any action.", "utterranceID": "20260828-6-de621"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-6-de621"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_802e8eff", "timestamp": "2026-08-28T08:19:00", "text": "Agreed. Thanks for the thorough investigation, Ian.", "utterranceID": "20260828-7-2acdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260828-7-2acdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-charliegarcia-SentimentForce", "channelID": "ch-force-7aff5a"}, "Message": {"Us

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-30T16:18:00", "text": "Awesome, Fiona! Lastly, there's a bug in Rocket.Chat about delayed message updates in active channels. Users are facing delays in real-time communication, which mirrors our issue with delayed summary updates. Here's the PR: https://github.com/RocketChat/Rocket.Chat/pull/110. Could you also take a look at this, Fiona?", "utterranceID": "20270530-5-438da"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270530-5-438da"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-30T16:20:00", "text": "Absolutely, David! Real-time updates are crucial for both us and Rocket.Chat. I'll analyze their solution and see if we can implement something similar to improve our backend processing. 🔧", "utterranceID": "20270530-6-742df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270530-6-742df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-30T16:24:00", "text": "Thanks for jumping on these, Fiona and Charlie! Let's keep these insights in mind as we work on our fixes. If you need any more info or run into any roadblocks, just let me know. Let's make our product even better! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270530-7-d6fdd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270530-7-d6fdd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-30T16:29:00", "text": "Will do, David! Let's leverage these open-source solutions to enhance our own. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270530-8-a045b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270530-8-a045b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-30T16:30:00", "text": "On it! Thanks for the support, team. Let's make it happen! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270530-9-70adf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270530-9-70adf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:09:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270606-0-1ae10"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-0-1ae10"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:11:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Suboptimal Data Partitioning' issue. The system is experiencing slowdowns due to inefficient data partitioning, affecting the performance of distributed queries across database shards. This impacts the Database & Performance area, causing slow response times for users, which can hinder productivity. Impacted customer: CUST-0053. @eid_4812cbd8, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270606-1-bcc61"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-1-bcc61"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:13:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the data partitioning issue and see how we can optimize it to improve performance. Thanks for the heads-up! 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270606-2-37ef3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-2-37ef3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:16:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have an 'Excessive Client-Side Computation' issue. The client-side is performing heavy computation for summarizing conversations, making the UI unresponsive. This affects the User Interface & Client-Side Processing area, interrupting users' workflow. Impacted customer: CUST-0082. @eid_4812cbd8, you're up again!", "utterranceID": "20270606-3-e71a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-3-e71a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-06T06:20:00", "text": "Understood! I'll work on optimizing the client-side processing to ensure the UI remains responsive. Let's keep our users happy! 😄", "utterranceID": "20270606-4-892ba"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270606-4-892ba"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:52:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie. This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's resolved. I'll review the PR shortly.", "utterranceID": "20270524-4-070c8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-4-070c8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-24T13:54:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David. Let me know if you have any questions or need further clarification on the changes.", "utterranceID": "20270524-5-a71ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270524-5-a71ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:00:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Inefficient Event Handling' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SummarizeForce/pull/40.", "utterranceID": "20270525-0-876df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-0-876df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:01:00", "text": "The root cause was that event listeners were not properly managed, leading to multiple redundant operations being executed simultaneously, which caused the UI to become sluggish.", "utterranceID": "20270525-1-2d1e8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-1-2d1e8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:05:00", "text": "To fix this, I consolidated the event listeners and ensured that each event triggers only the necessary operations. This optimization should prevent any redundant processing and improve the UI performance.", "utterranceID": "20270525-2-7af30"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-2-7af30"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:08:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_e3c15ff5! Thanks for tackling this issue. The sluggishness was really affecting the user experience.", "utterranceID": "20270525-3-68eef"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-3-68eef"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:10:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona! This should make a big difference. I'll run some tests to ensure everything is smooth now.", "utterranceID": "20270525-4-63467"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-4-63467"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:14:00", "text": "Thanks, Charlie and David. Let me know if you encounter any further issues during testing.", "utterranceID": "20270525-5-d5747"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-5-d5747"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-26T01:18:00", "text": "Will do, Fiona. Appreciate the quick turnaround on this!", "utterranceID": "20270525-6-cc616"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270525-6-cc616"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:23:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address ASAP. Let's go through them one by one. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270529-0-2c3be"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-0-2c3be"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:25:00", "text": "First up, we have a concurrency control bottleneck issue. High contention for database resources during concurrent summarization requests is causing increased wait times and reduced throughput. This is impacting our Database & Performance area and affecting customer CUST-0090. @eid_686130c8, can you take this one?", "utterranceID": "20270529-1-1de1b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-1-1de1b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:27:00", "text": "Got it! I'll dive into the database performance and see what's causing the bottleneck. Thanks for the heads-up! 👍", "utterranceID": "20270529-2-c4e89"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-2-c4e89"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-05-29T10:31:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_686130c8! Next, we have an issue with inconsistent tone and style adaptation. The summarizer isn't maintaining the tone and style for non-English conversations, leading to disjointed summaries. This affects our AI Model & Language Processing and impacts customer CUST-0072. @eid_e3c15ff5, can you handle this?", "utterranceID": "20270529-3-42528"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270529-3-42528"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:28:00", "text": "Hi team, I found some interesting bugs in open-source projects that are similar to the ones we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's take a look and see if we can learn anything from them! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270429-0-9512b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-0-9512b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:32:00", "text": "First up, we have an issue in React titled 'Inefficient Re-renders in Component Updates'. This is causing the UI to lag due to frequent and unnecessary re-renders, similar to our 'Inefficient DOM Updates'. You can check out the PR here: https://github.com/facebook/react/pull/100. @eid_4df5d4b7, this might be useful for your DOM optimization work.", "utterranceID": "20270429-1-19d24"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-1-19d24"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:33:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll definitely take a look at how React is handling this. It might give us some insights into optimizing our own UI updates. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270429-2-dd4f7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-2-dd4f7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:38:00", "text": "Next, there's a bug in Django called 'Excessive Query Rate Limiting'. It deals with misconfigured rate limits on database queries, leading to delays in data retrieval. Sounds a lot like our 'API Rate Limiting Misconfiguration'. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/django/django/pull/101. Julia, this could be relevant for your API configuration work.", "utterranceID": "20270429-3-e9ce7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-3-e9ce7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:39:00", "text": "Great find, Emma! I'll review the Django PR to see how they approached the rate limiting issue. It might help us adjust our API settings more effectively. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270429-4-f4580"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-4-f4580"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:44:00", "text": "Lastly, there's an issue in Electron titled 'UI Freezes on Large Data Processing'. The UI becomes unresponsive when processing large datasets, which is similar to our 'UI Freezes During Summary Generation'. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/electron/electron/pull/102. Bob, this might be helpful for the UI freezing issue you're working on.", "utterranceID": "20270429-5-6cbac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-5-6cbac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:48:00", "text": "Thanks, Emma! I'll dive into the Electron PR and see if there are any strategies we can apply to our situation. Improving performance for large data processing is definitely a priority. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270429-6-9606f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-6-9606f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:53:00", "text": "Awesome! Let's keep these examples in mind as we work on our fixes. If you find anything particularly useful, feel free to share it with the team. Let's aim for a smooth resolution for our customers! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270429-7-ce9cc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-7-ce9cc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_13cb0e90", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:54:00", "text": "Will do, Emma! Thanks for pulling these examples together. Let's get to work and make our users happy! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270429-8-34773"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-8-34773"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4df5d4b7", "timestamp": "2027-04-29T19:55:00", "text": "Absolutely! Thanks for the resources, Emma. Let's make sure our solutions are top-notch. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270429-9-ba92c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270429-9-ba92c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-emmamiller-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-4ea428"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d96fb219", "timestamp": "2027-05-15T16:36:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with SummarizeForce that we need to address. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270515-0-e8ba4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270515-0-e8ba4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-09T12:38:00", "text": "Awesome, Alice! Lastly, there's a Redis bug titled 'Concurrency Issue in Pub/Sub Messaging'. It describes how simultaneous message updates lead to incomplete data processing, causing outdated information to be delivered. This mirrors our 'Concurrency Handling Flaw'. Here's the PR: https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/114. Any insights?", "utterranceID": "20270609-5-ce0e1"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270609-5-ce0e1"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-09T12:39:00", "text": "The Redis issue is definitely relevant. I'll look into how they handled concurrency to ensure accurate data processing. This could help us refine our backend processing for real-time updates. 💪", "utterranceID": "20270609-6-648f4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270609-6-648f4"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-09T12:41:00", "text": "Thanks, Alice, for taking the lead on these. If you need any more context or help, just let me know. Let's leverage these open-source solutions to enhance our own products! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270609-7-0aed7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270609-7-0aed7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_4812cbd8", "timestamp": "2027-06-09T12:44:00", "text": "Will do, David! I'll keep you posted on any findings or potential strategies we can implement. Let's make sure our customers have the best experience possible. 👍", "utterranceID": "20270609-8-b2090"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270609-8-b2090"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:40:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the delayed summary updates for active conversations.", "utterranceID": "20270618-0-e3a63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-0-e3a63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:43:00", "text": "The issue is that SummarizeForce doesn't update summaries in real-time, which was initially thought to be a bug.", "utterranceID": "20270618-1-2fadb"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-1-2fadb"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:46:00", "text": "After reviewing the system's design and functionality, it turns out this behavior is actually expected.", "utterranceID": "20270618-2-8e287"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-2-8e287"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:48:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, Fiona. Can you explain why it's expected behavior?", "utterranceID": "20270618-3-ada6d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-3-ada6d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:52:00", "text": "Sure, Charlie. The system uses a polling mechanism that intentionally introduces a delay to reduce server load and optimize performance.", "utterranceID": "20270618-4-ac774"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-4-ac774"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:54:00", "text": "Real-time updates would require a significant increase in resource allocation, which isn't feasible with our current infrastructure.", "utterranceID": "20270618-5-2e655"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-5-2e655"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T17:57:00", "text": "Got it, Fiona. So, it's more about balancing performance and resource usage?", "utterranceID": "20270618-6-ce278"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-6-ce278"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T18:02:00", "text": "Exactly, @eid_f4f58faa. We did a thorough review of the backend processing pipeline and confirmed that the latency is within acceptable limits.", "utterranceID": "20270618-7-72852"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-7-72852"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T18:04:00", "text": "Thanks for clarifying, Fiona. It's good to know that it's not a bug but a design choice.", "utterranceID": "20270618-8-4e0ac"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-8-4e0ac"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-06-18T18:07:00", "text": "No problem, Charlie. If there are any further questions or concerns, feel free to reach out!", "utterranceID": "20270618-9-b948e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270618-9-b948e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-06-19T23:50:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Concurrency Control Bottlenecks' has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/SummarizeForce/pull/43.", "utterranceID": "20270619-0-7d50b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270619-0-7d50b"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:32:00", "text": "To fix this, I refactored the code to ensure that event listeners are removed when they're no longer needed and optimized the way DOM elements are managed. This should prevent the memory leak from occurring in the future.", "utterranceID": "20270302-2-f59df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-2-f59df"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:33:00", "text": "Great work, Charlie! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. I'll test it out with some large conversations to make sure everything is running smoothly.", "utterranceID": "20270302-3-43b13"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-3-43b13"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:34:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_686130c8! This was a critical issue, and I'm glad it's been addressed. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20270302-4-d536b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-4-d536b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-02T16:36:00", "text": "Thanks, Fiona and David! Please let me know if you encounter any more issues during testing. I'm here to help.", "utterranceID": "20270302-5-5081e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270302-5-5081e"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:32:00", "text": "Hi team, I looked into the reported issue about the summarizer not capturing the context of non-English conversations accurately.", "utterranceID": "20270303-0-6d5a5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-0-6d5a5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:35:00", "text": "After reviewing the details, I've determined that this is not a bug that requires fixing.", "utterranceID": "20270303-1-d0200"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-1-d0200"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:38:00", "text": "The root cause is that the AI model lacks sufficient contextual training data for non-English languages, which affects its understanding of idiomatic expressions and cultural references.", "utterranceID": "20270303-2-f659b"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-2-f659b"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:40:00", "text": "@Charlie Smith, could you elaborate on why this doesn't need a fix?", "utterranceID": "20270303-3-fd73d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-3-fd73d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:44:00", "text": "Sure, Fiona. The summarizer is currently designed to work optimally with English conversations. The behavior observed is expected given the current training data limitations.", "utterranceID": "20270303-4-8a787"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-4-8a787"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:47:00", "text": "We validated this by reviewing the model's training data and confirming that it aligns with the expected performance for non-English inputs.", "utterranceID": "20270303-5-83b79"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-5-83b79"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f4f58faa", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:52:00", "text": "Thanks for the clarification, Charlie. So, it's more of a limitation rather than a bug?", "utterranceID": "20270303-6-c2e59"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-6-c2e59"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_686130c8", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:53:00", "text": "Exactly, David. It's a known limitation. We can consider expanding the training data for non-English languages in future updates, but it's not a defect in the current implementation.", "utterranceID": "20270303-7-8cc46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-7-8cc46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-davidgarcia-SummarizeForce", "channelID": "ch-force-9223c9"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_e3c15ff5", "timestamp": "2027-03-04T05:58:00", "text": "Got it. Thanks for the update, Charlie. Let's keep this in mind for future improvements.", "utterranceID": "20270303-8-14284"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270303-8-14284"}
