{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:25:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect token expiry times, titled 'Token Expiry Mismatch', has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/67.", "utterranceID": "20270321-0-eebe2"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-0-eebe2"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:29:00", "text": "The root cause was a discrepancy between the token expiry time set in our CollaborateForce API and the expiry time recognized by external applications. This was due to incorrect time zone handling.", "utterranceID": "20270321-1-8a162"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-1-8a162"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:34:00", "text": "To fix this, I updated the API to standardize all token expiry times to UTC. Additionally, I added a conversion utility to ensure that any time zone differences are correctly handled before tokens are issued.", "utterranceID": "20270321-2-48f8c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-2-48f8c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:36:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_86f94a48! Thanks for jumping on this so quickly. This should help reduce those authentication failures we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20270321-3-cd414"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-3-cd414"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-22T01:37:00", "text": "Thanks, Bob Brown! If anyone notices any further issues or has questions, feel free to reach out.", "utterranceID": "20270321-4-67032"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270321-4-67032"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-03-25T06:35:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Flaw' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/CollaborateForce/pull/68.", "utterranceID": "20270325-0-880b5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270325-0-880b5"}

{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_0dd1bf2e", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:30:00", "text": "@eid_54b986cf, I agree with Hannah. Also, in the 'Non-Functional Requirements' section, we should specify performance benchmarks, like response times for AI-generated insights. This will help us set clear expectations for QA testing.", "utterranceID": "20260607-2-3c7db"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-2-3c7db"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_53a6add1", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:35:00", "text": "From a UX perspective, I think the 'user interface should be intuitive and user-friendly' is a bit vague. Can we define what 'intuitive' means in this context? Maybe include some user personas or scenarios to guide design decisions?", "utterranceID": "20260607-3-bef2a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-3-bef2a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:39:00", "text": "Good point, Julia. Also, regarding 'Integration Requirements', it might be beneficial to specify which APIs we plan to support initially. This could help prioritize development efforts and manage user expectations.", "utterranceID": "20260607-4-3f6e9"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-4-3f6e9"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_272ed674", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:40:00", "text": "I think we should also expand on the 'Challenges' section. Specifically, how do we plan to address data privacy concerns? Maybe outline some initial strategies or technologies we plan to use.", "utterranceID": "20260607-5-69460"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-5-69460"}
{"Channel": {"name": "planning-CollaborateForce-PM", "channelID": "ch-ix-pm-d3ea0a"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_54b986cf", "timestamp": "2026-06-07T23:41:00", "text": "Great feedback, everyone! @eid_16935c12, I'll add more specifics about the types of predictive analytics. @eid_0dd1bf2e, let's include performance benchmarks for AI insights. @eid_53a6add1, I'll work with you to define 'intuitive' using user personas. @eid_d3a4fc8f, I'll specify initial APIs. @eid_272ed674, I'll expand on data privacy strategies. Let's aim to have these updates by end of week. Does that work for everyone? 👍", "utterranceID": "20260607-6-d4761"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260607-6-d4761"}
