{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "slack_admin_bot", "timestamp": "2027-02-05T15:28:00", "text": "@eid_d3a4fc8f joined bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce. Also, @eid_c42e5095, @eid_01e37306, @eid_86f94a48, @eid_724e1180, @eid_8cbee5b3 joined via invite.", "utterranceID": "20270205-1-aaba8"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-1-aaba8"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:52:00", "text": "Hi team, several customers are reporting issues with CollaborateForce that need our attention. Let's go through them one by one. 😊", "utterranceID": "20270205-0-76fbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-0-76fbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:55:00", "text": "First up, we have a 'Token Expiry Mismatch' issue. External applications are experiencing unexpected token expiry, causing authentication failures during API requests. This affects the API Authentication Layer and is impacting CUST-0049. @eid_86f94a48, this one's for you.", "utterranceID": "20270205-1-7283a"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-1-7283a"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T02:58:00", "text": "Got it! I'll start looking into the token expiry issue right away. Thanks for the heads-up! 🔍", "utterranceID": "20270205-2-18afc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-2-18afc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:00:00", "text": "Great, thanks! Next, we have a 'Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Flaw'. This vulnerability allows attackers to inject malicious scripts into collaborative discussions, which could expose sensitive data. It's affecting the Security Module and impacting CUST-0017. @eid_86f94a48, you're up again.", "utterranceID": "20270205-3-d4d74"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-3-d4d74"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:05:00", "text": "Understood. I'll prioritize the XSS flaw and ensure we patch it up ASAP. Security is key! 🔐", "utterranceID": "20270205-4-b8acf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-4-b8acf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:06:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks for jumping on that! Lastly, we have 'Delayed Data Point Updates'. The AI Suggestion Engine isn't incorporating the most recent data updates, leading to outdated recommendations. This affects the AI Suggestion Engine and is impacting CUST-0026. @eid_86f94a48, this one's also for you.", "utterranceID": "20270205-5-df108"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-5-df108"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:10:00", "text": "Thanks for the info. I'll dive into the AI Suggestion Engine issue and work on getting those updates flowing smoothly again. 🚀", "utterranceID": "20270205-6-9d76c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-6-9d76c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:15:00", "text": "Thanks, @eid_86f94a48, for taking on these issues. If anyone has questions or needs more context, feel free to ask. Let's keep our customers happy! 🙌", "utterranceID": "20270205-7-68c0f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-7-68c0f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_86f94a48", "timestamp": "2027-02-06T03:20:00", "text": "No problem! If anyone has insights or needs to collaborate on these, just ping me. Let's get these sorted! 💪", "utterranceID": "20270205-8-e53a7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270205-8-e53a7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-bobbrown-CollaborateForce", "channelID": "ch-force-a5e3e1"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_d3a4fc8f", "timestamp": "2027-02-07T08:58:00", "text": "Hi team, I've found some interesting open-source bugs that mirror the issues we're tackling in Salesforce. Let's dive in and see what we can learn! 😊", "utterranceID": "20270207-0-557ab"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20270207-0-557ab"}

