{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_90359c89", "timestamp": "2026-10-11T01:19:00", "text": "Thanks, all! Let's fix these bugs! 🐛", "utterranceID": "20261010-10-331ad"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261010-10-331ad"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:18:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'Data Serialization Bottleneck' has been resolved. You can check the details in the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/48.", "utterranceID": "20261018-0-90780"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-0-90780"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:20:00", "text": "Great news, David! Can you remind us what the root cause was?", "utterranceID": "20261018-1-3021f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-1-3021f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:23:00", "text": "Sure, Ian. The root cause was an outdated serialization library that wasn't optimized for the complex data structures we use in LeadForce. This was causing slow data processing and delays in data transmission.", "utterranceID": "20261018-2-0dbb5"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-2-0dbb5"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:24:00", "text": "Thanks for the update, David. How did you manage to fix it?", "utterranceID": "20261018-3-dd8c3"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-3-dd8c3"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_cac9a0ac", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:26:00", "text": "We updated the serialization library to a more recent version that supports our complex data structures more efficiently. Additionally, I refactored some of the data handling logic to better align with the new library's capabilities. This significantly improved the serialization speed.", "utterranceID": "20261018-4-7776f"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-4-7776f"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-10-18T16:29:00", "text": "Awesome work, @eid_cac9a0ac! This should really help with the performance issues we've been seeing.", "utterranceID": "20261018-5-49ee4"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261018-5-49ee4"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:14:00", "text": "First up, there's a bug in Kubernetes titled 'API Server Rate Limiting Under Load'. It describes how high traffic causes the API server to throttle requests, leading to delayed responses for cluster operations. Here's the PR link: https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/601. @eid_a43a4389, this seems similar to our API rate limiting issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260905-1-aee63"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-1-aee63"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:18:00", "text": "Thanks for sharing, Ian! This is definitely relevant. The way Kubernetes handles rate limiting could give us some insights into optimizing our API Gateway. I'll dive into the PR and see if there are any strategies we can adopt. 👍", "utterranceID": "20260905-2-12afd"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-2-12afd"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:22:00", "text": "Great! Next, we have an Nginx issue titled 'Uneven Load Distribution Across Servers'. It talks about misconfigured load balancing resulting in some servers being overloaded while others remain underutilized. Check out the PR here: https://github.com/nginx/nginx/pull/602. Bob, this sounds a lot like our load balancer problem. Thoughts?", "utterranceID": "20260905-3-8227d"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-3-8227d"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:24:00", "text": "Absolutely, Ian! This is spot on. I'll review the Nginx PR to see how they tackled the load distribution. It might give us some ideas on how to adjust our settings for better balance. 💪", "utterranceID": "20260905-4-8da33"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-4-8da33"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:26:00", "text": "Awesome, thanks Bob! Lastly, there's an Apache Kafka issue titled 'Incorrect Data Aggregation in Streams'. It involves faulty logic in stream processing leading to inaccurate aggregation of event data. Here's the PR: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/603. Ian, this seems related to our data aggregation logic issue. What do you think?", "utterranceID": "20260905-5-9d21c"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-5-9d21c"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:29:00", "text": "Thanks, Ian! This is definitely relevant. I'll look into how Kafka addressed their aggregation logic and see if we can apply similar fixes to our system. 🛠️", "utterranceID": "20260905-6-af353"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-6-af353"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_f98d7490", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:30:00", "text": "Thanks, everyone! Let's keep these open-source solutions in mind as we work on our issues. Feel free to reach out if you need any help or want to discuss further. 🙌", "utterranceID": "20260905-7-dca99"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-7-dca99"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a43a4389", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:33:00", "text": "Will do! I'll keep you posted on any findings from the Kubernetes PR. 😊", "utterranceID": "20260905-8-cd9fc"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-8-cd9fc"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:34:00", "text": "Same here, I'll update once I have more insights from the Nginx PR. 🖥️", "utterranceID": "20260905-9-58526"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-9-58526"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_207da0e7", "timestamp": "2026-09-05T14:39:00", "text": "I'll share updates on the Kafka aggregation fix soon. Thanks, team! 🤝", "utterranceID": "20260905-10-0ee23"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260905-10-0ee23"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-iangarcia-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-bd5140"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_a23a73c4", "timestamp": "2026-09-07T00:04:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug about incorrect load balancing in front of the API Gateway has been resolved. You can check the details in the PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/45.", "utterranceID": "20260906-0-6e5df"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20260906-0-6e5df"}

{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:21:00", "text": "Hi team, the bug titled 'UI Lag Due to Excessive DOM Updates' has been resolved. You can check out the approved PR here: https://github.com/salesforce/LeadForce/pull/57.", "utterranceID": "20261119-0-79e15"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-0-79e15"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:25:00", "text": "The root cause was inefficient DOM manipulation during the import process, which led to performance bottlenecks and caused the UI to lag.", "utterranceID": "20261119-1-13ba7"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-1-13ba7"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_3f4b2681", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:26:00", "text": "To fix this, I optimized the DOM updates by batching them together instead of updating the DOM on every single change. This reduces the number of reflows and repaints, significantly improving performance.", "utterranceID": "20261119-2-f4bc0"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-2-f4bc0"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_c39dc658", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:29:00", "text": "Great work, @eid_3f4b2681! That should make a big difference for users during the import process.", "utterranceID": "20261119-3-dbfbf"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-3-dbfbf"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_652e8cd0", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:30:00", "text": "Thanks, Hannah! This should really help with the user experience. I'll test it out and let you know if I spot anything.", "utterranceID": "20261119-4-12e46"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-4-12e46"}
{"Channel": {"name": "bug-ianjones-LeadForce", "channelID": "ch-force-585771"}, "Message": {"User": {"userId": "eid_99835861", "timestamp": "2026-11-20T05:33:00", "text": "Nice job, Hannah. Batching DOM updates sounds like a smart move. Let me know if you need any help with further testing.", "utterranceID": "20261119-5-69a7e"}, "Reactions": []}, "ThreadReplies": [], "id": "20261119-5-69a7e"}
